<title>SOUTH AFRICA: South Africa's SFW lifts interim dividend.</title>
<headline>South Africa's SFW lifts interim dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stellenbosch Farmers' Winery Group Ltd on Thursday declared an interim dividend of seven cents for the six months to December 31, against six cents a year ago.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that shareholders registered on February 21 would qualify for the dividend, which would be mailed on February 28.</p>
<p>The group's interim report would be published before the end of February, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
